From 8b080eeaa3bd3f3e60153a33f6fa006ac21f0895 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: amperstand <atlas@oh-my-opencode.com>
Date: Sat, 29 Aug 2026 08:10:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] fix(core): support custom methods in quote snapshot
 import/export

- mintQuoteFromSnapshot: route stateful custom-method snapshots through the
  bolt11-shaped import path with the original method preserved instead of
  throwing 'Unsupported mint quote import method'
- mintQuoteToMethodSnapshot: preserve quote.method (was hardcoded bolt12)
  and read pubkey from the quote base, fixing watcher endpoint routing and
  persisted snapshot labels for custom methods
